  <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInAndImportantAdditionsToFranchiseRightsTextBlock id="f-30" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:9pt;padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:9.67pt"&gt;Please refer to the Legal Proceedings section of the Notes to the Financial Statements starting on page 123.1.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInAndImportantAdditionsToFranchiseRightsTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfAcquisitionOfOwnershipInOtherCompaniesByReorganizationMergerOrConsolidationWithOtherCompaniesTextBlock id="f-31" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:9pt;padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:9.67pt"&gt;None.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfAcquisitionOfOwnershipInOtherCompaniesByReorganizationMergerOrConsolidationWithOtherCompaniesTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfPurchaseOrSaleOfAnOperatingUnitOrSystemTextBlock id="f-32" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:9pt;padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:9.67pt"&gt;None.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfPurchaseOrSaleOfAnOperatingUnitOrSystemTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfImportantLeaseholdsThatHaveBeenAcquiredOrGivenAssignedOrSurrenderedTextBlock id="f-33" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-bottom:9pt;margin-top:9pt;padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%;padding-left:9.67pt"&gt;SDG&amp;amp;E extended the sublease term for space located on Joe Crosson Dr. through 10/31/2031&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfImportantLeaseholdsThatHaveBeenAcquiredOrGivenAssignedOrSurrenderedTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfImportantExtensionOrReductionOfTransmissionOrDistributionSystemTextBlock id="f-34" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:9pt;padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:9.67pt"&gt;In the first quarter of 2026 notable changes to the Transmission System included:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt; TL602 [STATION B SUB. - SILVERGATE SUB.]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt; WO# 2478618 UNDERGROUND CABLE REPLACEMENT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt; ADD SG RACK - STATION B RACK UG 1-1750 KCMIL CU 3 MILES&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt; DEL SG RACK - STATIO B RACK UG 1-1750 MCM AL 2.84 MILES&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt; TL668 [MIRAMAR GAS TURBINE - MIRAMAR SUB.]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt; WO# 2651922 3 ROOTS EAST/WEST RELOCATION&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt; DEL MRGT RACK - Z96968 1-1033.5 ACSR/AW 2.06 MILES&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt; DEL Z96968 - MR RACK 1-1033.5 ACSR/AW 1.56 MILES&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt; ADD MRGT RACK - Z100528 1-1033.5 ACSR/AW 1.29 MILES&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt; ADD Z100528 - Z100529 UG 1-3000 KCMIL CU 1.01 MILES&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt; ADD Z100529 - MR RACK 1-1033.5 ACSR/AW 1.40 MILES &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt; There were no important changes to the Distribution System in the first quarter of 2026.&lt;/span&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfImportantExtensionOrReductionOfTransmissionOrDistributionSystemTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfObligationsIncurredOrAssumedByRespondentAsGuarantorForThePerformanceByAnotherOfAnyAgreementOrObligationTextBlock id="f-35" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:9pt;padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:9.67pt"&gt;On March 20, 2026, SDG&amp;amp;E issued $625 million of 5.200% First Mortgage Bonds, Series DDDD, due March 15, 2036, and $475 million of 5.950% First Mortgage Bonds, Series EEEE, due March 15, 2056. &#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:9pt;padding-left:18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;During the 1st quarter of 2026 San Diego Gas &amp;amp; Electric issued commercial paper with an average daily balance of $328.9 million and a maximum outstanding balance of $549.5 million. The quarter-end balance was $0.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfObligationsIncurredOrAssumedByRespondentAsGuarantorForThePerformanceByAnotherOfAnyAgreementOrObligationTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInArticlesOfIncorporationOrAmendmentsToCharterTextBlock id="f-36" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:9pt;padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:9.67pt"&gt;None.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInArticlesOfIncorporationOrAmendmentsToCharterTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock id="f-37" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:9pt;padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:9.67pt"&gt;None.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock>
